    "text": "We know that <math><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> given statement is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Which is a tautology <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>as</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
